# Results (keep .gitkeep, ignore everything else — regenerated per run).
# `results/**` not `results/*.json`: the old per-extension globs matched only the
# TOP level, so any subdirectory was committable. Found 2026-08-07, when the
# Sharanga retrieval created results/_sharanga_logs/*.out (Slurm logs) and
# results/_csis_qwen3-32b_2026-06-22/ (superseded-run backup) — 88 files, incl.
# cluster logs, staged clean for `git add -A` in this PUBLIC repo. Slurm logs can
# carry /home/<user> paths and node hostnames; never let results/ leak.
results/**
!results/.gitkeep

